          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bwenebwene mukiidhi ng'ababa mu ntaka edh'okulumuka baba kamaala, aye aghangula ekirabo aba mulala. Kale mulumuke mu nsambo ebasobozesa okughangula ekirabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.9.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.9.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 9:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Buli muzaanhi azaanha emizaanho egy'entaka, yeegendereza inho asobole okufuna ekirabo eky'ekiseera obuseera, aye ife twegendereza inho tufune ekirabo ekitawaagho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.9.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.9.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 9:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nze kyenva numuka butereevu ku kagugha, tiri ng'oti n'omukubi w'ebifunsi akuba eibanga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.9.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.9.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 9:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nfuntira irala omubiri gwange era naagufugira irala, nze ndobe kutoolebwa mu ntaka nga mmaze okukobera abandi Amawulire Amalungi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.9.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.9.27"
            ]
          }
        }
